OL,3,GNEWSAFlats #30k repair bills 'a shock'
OL,4,Asay leaseholders
OL,5,
OL,6,FLeaseholders on an estate in Woking say
OL,7,Fthey are facing bills of tens of
OL,8,Fthousands of pounds from their
OL,9,Ffreeholder, Woking Borough Council,
OL,10,Fbecause of a major refurbishment
OL,11,Fproject.
OL,13,FAs well as the removal of cladding on
OL,14,Fbuildings at the Lakeview estate in
OL,15,FHorsell, there are due to be works at
OL,16,F14 medium-rise blocks, including new
OL,17,Fwall insulation and roof renewals.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,328,320,200,140,0,100
