OL,3,GNEWSAFlats #30k repair bills 'a shock'
OL,4,Asay leaseholders
OL,5,
OL,6,FSome homeowners have told BBC Radio
OL,7,FSurrey they will struggle to afford the
OL,8,Festimated payments, with one man saying
OL,9,Fhe will need to pay #30,000 for the
OL,10,Fwork.
OL,12,FThe Liberal Democrat leader of the
OL,13,Fcouncil, Ann-Marie Barker, said the
OL,14,Fsize of contributions would vary and
OL,15,Fpeople would only pay when works to
OL,16,Findividual blocks were completed.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
